& [CanonicalRecord: PostP6SurfaceImplementationDownstreamReentry] is the processed planning authority for P7/P9 downstream reentry after P6 surface implementation acceptance
  + [canonical_uuid] is a2d6d691-f97f-4b43-b72d-b09bd4c13b48
  + [source_manifest_uuid] is 86cc8767-e77a-439d-a06f-d2a54d7fd309
  + [readiness_surface_uuid] is e5173b64-d991-4210-b775-d7fedce4ab3f
  + [slice_surface_uuid] is 55a4dbba-ea1e-4d40-a97f-613fe82254c5
  + [authority_scope] is downstream P7/P9 planning reentry, final slice order, boundary imports, authority-gap inventory, coordination identity contracts, cross-surface carrier contracts, conflict and human override contracts, operations-manager safety taxonomy, dry-run and refusal contracts, approval credential network rollback emergency-stop contracts, fixture oracle planning, implementation deferral, model routing, stale triggers, and forbidden live-control scope
  + [implementation_scope] is planning authority and final slice minting only
  + [depends_on] is docs/canonical/LangSOP_P6_Surface_Implementation_Activation.canonical.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/slices/P6_Surface_Implementation_Activation_Slices.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/P6_Surface_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/reviews/P6_Surface_Implementation_Completion_Review.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/Post_P6_Surface_Implementation_Readiness_Surface.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/decisions/P6_Surface_Dependency_Adapter_Transport_UI_Langflow_Dispatch_Operations_And_Live_Control_Deferral_Decision.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/canonical/LangSOP_Post_IR8_Implementation_Readiness.canonical.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/Post_IR8_Implementation_Readiness_Surface.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/IR6_Coordination_Mailbox_Projection_Prototype_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/IR7_Operations_Dry_Run_Simulator_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/IR8_Integrated_Manager_Orchestration_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/FSC5_Operations_Safety_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/canonical/LangSOP_Operations_Safety_Spec.canonical.sop

  = must: use docs/planning/Post_P6_Surface_Implementation_Downstream_Reentry_Surface.v1.sop as the current downstream reentry readiness surface
  = must: use docs/slices/P7_P9_Downstream_Reentry_Final_Slices.v1.sop as the current downstream reentry slice surface after minting review accepts
  = must: execute P7P9-DR01 first
  = must: run completion review after every P7/P9 downstream reentry slice before opening the next gated slice
  = must: preserve typed-kernel source authority over chat protocol, surface projection, mailbox carrier, graph checkpoint, manager packet, work packet, dry-run result, and generated output records
  = must: preserve that P6 surface implementation evidence supports downstream planning and no-live-effect proof but does not authorize adapters, transports, UI, assignment, dispatch, operations control, or live machine control
  - never: treat this canonical specification as permission for dependency installation, package metadata mutation, mailbox IO, adapter implementation, transport implementation, UI implementation, Langflow export, IRC/Matrix/web/MCP implementation, assignment, dispatch, command execution, process control, GPU control, model runtime mutation, job dispatch, credential access, network mutation, destructive filesystem action, persistent operations automation, operations control, or live machine control

& [CanonicalP7P9DownstreamReentrySliceSet] is the final downstream reentry slice sequence
  + [slice] is P7P9-DR01 shared boundary import and authority gap inventory
  + [slice] is P7P9-DR02 participant, conversation identity, and authority class contract
  + [slice] is P7P9-DR03 work claim, assignment candidate, and dispatch refusal contract
  + [slice] is P7P9-DR04 cross-surface carrier, conversation, and rendezvous projection contract
  + [slice] is P7P9-DR05 conflict, staleness, human override, and completion review contract
  + [slice] is P7P9-DR06 operations-manager safety boundary and resource taxonomy
  + [slice] is P7P9-DR07 operations-manager dry-run request, result, and refusal contract
  + [slice] is P7P9-DR08 approval, credential, network, rollback, and emergency-stop contract
  + [slice] is P7P9-DR09 fixture oracle and generated-output boundary plan
  + [slice] is P7P9-DR10 completion review, implementation deferral, and future activation pack

  = must: preserve this order unless a completion review rebakes downstream reentry

& [CanonicalP7P9DownstreamReentryExecutionGate] is the activation rule for downstream reentry
  + [current_ready_slice] is P7P9-DR01
  + [gated_slice] is P7P9-DR02 until P7P9-DR01 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is P7P9-DR03 until P7P9-DR02 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is P7P9-DR04 until P7P9-DR03 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is P7P9-DR05 until P7P9-DR04 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is P7P9-DR06 until P7P9-DR05 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is P7P9-DR07 until P7P9-DR06 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is P7P9-DR08 until P7P9-DR07 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is P7P9-DR09 until P7P9-DR08 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is P7P9-DR10 until P7P9-DR09 accepted
  + [completion_gate] is P7/P9 downstream reentry activation pack accepted after P7P9-DR10

& [CanonicalP7P9DownstreamReentryModelRouting] is the model-routing record
  + [downstream_reentry] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P7P9-DR01] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P7P9-DR02] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P7P9-DR03] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P7P9-DR04] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P7P9-DR05] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P7P9-DR06] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P7P9-DR07] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P7P9-DR08] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P7P9-DR09] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after P7P9-DR01 through P7P9-DR08 acceptance
  + [P7P9-DR10] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [future_bounded_fixture_updates] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after downstream contracts stabilize
  + [future_adapter_or_dispatch_authority] is requires deeper reasoning and separate source-preserved SJS authority
  + [future_live_control_reconsideration] is requires deeper reasoning and separate source-preserved safety authority

  = must: state Spark suitability or deeper-reasoning requirement in every future work packet

& [CanonicalP7P9DownstreamReentrySafetyLimit] is the inherited safety limit for downstream reentry
  + [P6_surface_implementation_status] is accepted_for_bounded_projection_and_no_live_effect_evidence_only
  + [IR6_coordination_status] is accepted_for_bounded_claim_and_mailbox_projection_evidence_only
  + [IR7_operations_dry_run_status] is accepted_for_dry_run_and_refusal_evidence_only
  + [IR8_manager_status] is accepted_for_manager_packet_and_handoff_evidence_only
  + [dependency_installation_authorized] is false
  + [package_metadata_mutation_authorized] is false
  + [mailbox_IO_authorized] is false
  + [adapter_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [transport_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [UI_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [Langflow_export_authorized] is false
  + [assignment_authorized] is false
  + [agent_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [manager_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [job_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [command_execution_authorized] is false
  + [process_control_authorized] is false
  + [GPU_control_authorized] is false
  + [model_runtime_mutation_authorized] is false
  + [credential_access_authorized] is false
  + [network_mutation_authorized] is false
  + [destructive_filesystem_action_authorized] is false
  + [persistent_operations_automation_authorized] is false
  + [operations_control_authorized] is false
  + [live_machine_control_authorized] is false

  = must: block command execution, process control, GPU control, model runtime mutation, job dispatch, credential access or mutation, network exposure mutation, destructive filesystem action, persistent operations automation, operations control, and live machine control
  = must: prevent manager packet readiness, work-packet readiness, dry-run success, fixture success, broad approval, projected intent, mailbox carrier state, coordination claim state, surface projection state, or graph checkpoint state from becoming assignment, dispatch, operations, or live-control authority

